#!/usr/bin/env sh

# 🔴 There is deliberately NO pre-push gate in this repository, and this file exists only
# because husky's hooks path (mobile/.husky/_) is set repo-wide by `npm install` in mobile/.
# Without the file, git would still find nothing to run; with it, the reason is written down.
#
# Why nothing runs here: the full checks — type-check, the 449-suite Jest run, lint, the
# translation and release gates — take minutes, and a push is not the moment to spend them.
# CI is the authoritative net (AGENTS.md says so explicitly). The pre-commit hook, which
# DOES run, carries the two gates that must never be skipped: the credential scan and the
# staged PHP tests.
#
# 🔴 This file used to say "Mobile pre-push hook disabled — mobile development on hold".
# That premise died long ago — mobile is one of the most active areas of the project — and
# the identical wording in the pre-commit file had silently disabled the credential scan on
# a PUBLIC repository for months. The comment is corrected rather than deleted so the next
# reader knows the absence is a decision, not neglect.
#
# Do not add a gate here without an explicit instruction. `scripts/pre-push-checks.sh` at
# the repo root is the bundle to run by hand.
exit 0
